  "description": "Standalone PDF digital-signature library for .NET — PAdES/CMS signing (PFX/PEM, deferred eSign/HSM/token), RFC-3161 timestamps, long-term validation and a green-tick appearance Adobe shows as valid. One package, cross-platform (Windows/Linux/macOS, x86/x64/ARM), .NET Framework 2.0 to the latest .NET.",
